#: scanparams.cpp:567
msgid ""
"<qt><b>Problem: No scanner found, or unable to access it</b><p>There was a "
"problem using the SANE (Scanner Access Now Easy) library to access the "
"scanner device.  There may be a problem with your SANE installation, or it "
"may not be configured to support your scanner.<p>Check that SANE is "
"correctly installed and configured on your system, and also that the scanner "
"device name and settings are correct.<p>See the SANE project home page (<a "
"href=\"http://www.sane-project.org\">www.sane-project.org</a>) for more "
"information on SANE installation and setup."
msgstr ""
"<qt><b>Problem: Skener nije pronađen, ili mu se ne može pristupiti</"
"b><p>Problem pri korištenju SANE (Scanner Access Now Easy) biblioteke pri "
"pristupu skener uređaju.  Možda postoji problem oko SANE instalacije, ili "
"nije konfigurisan da podržava ovaj skener uređaj.<p>Provjeri da li je SANE "
"ispravno instaliran i konfigurisan za ovaj sistem, i da li su ime skenera i "
"postavke tačne.<p>Idi na SANE početnu stranicu (<a href=\"http://www.sane-"
"project.org\">www.sane-project.org</a>) za više informacija o instalaciji i "
"postavkama."

